alty), so this plan loses the most to shortages.\n   - **Plan 0** orders about ×1.19–1.2. Leftover stock keeps building, and by the end roughly 160 units of product 0 are unsold. That wastes about 12 per unit plus storage. It also risks overflowing the 208-unit warehouse around day 12, when 150 + 45 units arrive on top of leftovers.\n   - **Plans 4 and 7** sit in between and are close. Plan 4 orders about ×1.10 for both products. Plan 7 orders about ×1.05 for product 0 and ×1.15 for product 1. The extra product 0 in plan 4 roughly pays for itself, because each shortage avoided is worth about 27 against a purchase cost of 12. The extra product 1 in plan 7 probably doesn't, because its margin is only 3. Plan 4 also has a little more warehouse room.\n\n4. **When demand differs from the forecast.** Plan 4 has enough stock to absorb above-forecast demand without the steady overstock of plan 0."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 356, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5807, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 356}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-19T01:58:25.933Z", "request_id": "req_011CgAmPeQ9TPTrPDDj2aBxd"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01BtpYSQPL3kzGiK4uhigYQg", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgAmPeuAgDiceMxmrDhS8", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_u